{"1443490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Siren Head: Awakening", "steam_appid": 1443490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out our newest game!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Siren Head returns to Steam with its best game yet, Siren Head: Awakening.<br><br>Siren Head: Awakening is a first-person horror game based on Trevor Henderson's artwork.<br><br>As I lead into the darkness of the woods in search of missing parts to fix my broken car, surrounded by the eerie sound of the susurration of the leaves in the gusty wind, my eyes meet the unknown; taller than the trees, a siren head - this decaying creature that paralyzes my existence.<br><br>Sweat dripping to the bottom of my spine, vast darkness ahead, fallen bodies of those before me with the same wretched fate, dusted letters I find along the way that guide me.<br><br>Will my world crumble beneath my feet or will I make it into the light?", "about_the_game": "Siren Head returns to Steam with its best game yet, Siren Head: Awakening.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSiren Head: Awakening is a first-person horror game based on Trevor Henderson's artwork.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs I lead into the darkness of the woods in search of missing parts to fix my broken car, surrounded by the eerie sound of the susurration of the leaves in the gusty wind, my eyes meet the unknown; taller than the trees, a siren head - this decaying creature that paralyzes my existence.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSweat dripping to the bottom of my spine, vast darkness ahead, fallen bodies of those before me with the same wretched fate, dusted letters I find along the way that guide me.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill my world crumble beneath my feet or will I make it into the light?", "short_description": "Siren Head: Awakening is a first-person horror game based on Trevor Henderson's artwork. You're stuck with your car in the middle of a dark forest with nothing but your flashlight. Seek escape by finding items necessary to survive while a terrifying monster lurks the shadows.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443490/header.jpg?t=1686673311", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1686673311", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1443490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1686673311", "website": "http://prismagames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista (32-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2120 / AMD Athlon 64 FX-72<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GT 520 / Radeon HD 2900 GT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible soundcard or onboard chipset<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> These specifications are bare minimum. To get playable frames, the in-game resolution must be dropped down.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 / AMD FX-6120<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GT 720 / Radeon HD 8670D<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible soundcard or onboard chipset</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2120 / AMD Athlon 64 FX-72<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graph